Fish Tank's saltwater fish
==========================

clownfish, blue tang, yellow tang, blue damselfish, royal gramma, pufferfish
(NAME.mesh, NAME.png) are from Reef Glass, a Roku screensaver by Tim Saucer:

    https://github.com/timsaucer/reef_glass_roku_screensaver

Its images and meshes are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Each fish was generated
as a keyed side photo (Z-Image-Turbo, Apache 2.0) and reconstructed in 3D
(TripoSR, MIT); see that project's CREDITS.md. The way the side photo is
projected onto the mesh's flanks follows its tools/fishviews.py.

For Firox they were simplified to ~6000 triangles, turned to the tank's axes
and their photos cropped and edge-softened by scripts/fishtank-assets.py.
